# kotlin-reflect warm-up (framework AppWarmup) for the classes Jackson KotlinModule introspects in JsWrapper.didLoadToLocation.
# Triggered synchronously when the EPUB viewer activity is created: after AppGuard finished swapping its dex zips
# (an earlier/background warm-up raced that and broke kotlin-reflect: "Built-in class kotlin.Any is not found").
# Preferred: on the main thread when idle, 5 s after the bookshelf is created (bookshelf appears ~15 s after
# process start, well after AppGuard's swap at 5-12 s), so the first book open doesn't pay the ~2 s.
# Fallback if the user opens a book before that: the viewer activity creation (runs only once per process).
@idle kr.co.millie.eink.bookshelf.BookshelfActivity 5000
@activity kr.co.millie.eink.epub.EPubViewActivity
kr.co.millie.core.epubbase.model.BookToc
kr.co.millie.core.epubbase.model.Book
